  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Is the Free plan really free?",
      "a": "Yes. Free covers two computers, the local dashboard, the Home Assistant integration, sensors, presence, notify, Assist and basic alerts. No card is required. It is a Leassh server license, not the OpenClaw Fleet plugin."
    },
    {
      "q": "What happens when the trial ends?",
      "a": "Family and Pro trials convert to the plan you chose unless you cancel before the trial ends. We email a reminder before conversion. If you cancel, your agents keep running but paid features stop."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I switch plans?",
      "a": "Yes. Upgrades take effect immediately. Downgrades take effect at the end of the current billing period; if the lower plan has fewer computers, existing nodes keep reporting and new nodes are blocked until you remove one."
    },
    {
      "q": "What counts as a computer?",
      "a": "Each Windows PC, Apple Silicon Mac, or Linux machine with a Leassh agent or SSH entry counts once. Phones and tablets do not run Leassh. See /platforms for the full support matrix."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does Leassh monitor phones?",
      "a": "No. Leassh is for computers. Use Google Family Link for Android and Apple Screen Time for iPhone and iPad, alongside Leassh for the computers in the house."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which payment methods do you accept?",
      "a": "Card payments through Stripe. Annual and monthly billing are available for Family and Pro."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the refund policy?",
      "a": "Email hello@leassh.com within 30 days of a charge and we will refund it. This is a commercial policy, not legal advice."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Unlimited include?",
      "a": "Unlimited computers, everything in Pro, priority support, and multi-site onboarding. Contact us for a quote; fair use applies to support and onboarding."
    }
  ]
